From 59f395beb92367ff2e31a69cf7b944c03f1c1554 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaptainCucumber <37813159+CaptainCucumber@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:53:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add single-player Copilot command semantics

Guard local dispatch against unsupported game states, make Copilot commands ignore shift estimates, and stamp observations with saved game ticks. Preserve synchronous callback outcomes.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

